  "body": "## What changed\n- Added per-post `declaredOptions` schema parsing, type/range validation, reserved host-key guards (`RESERVED_KEYS`), default resolution, and `programTools` stream extraction in `crates/post/src/post/options.rs`, `options_parse.rs`, and `engine.rs`.\n- Added `declaredOptions` schemas and option-driven output (such as sequence numbers, word spacing, optional stops, radius arcs, header info/tool lists, and controller toggles) across all eight shipped milling posts (`carvera.cps`, `doosan-dnm.cps`, `fanuc.cps`, `grblhal.cps`, `haas.cps`, `mazak.cps`, `tinyg.cps`, `tormach.cps`) while preserving default output byte-for-byte; documented the schema in `assets/posts/AGENTS.md`.\n- Added document and per-setup `PostScriptOptions` persistence (`schema.rs`, `project/*`, `setup_post_options.rs`) using the setup own-vs-follow law, and flagged multi-setup script option disagreements in `program_problems`.\n- Added undoable commands `SetPostScriptOptions`, `SetSetupPostScriptOptions`, and composite `SetPostSettings` (`crates/app/src/commands/post_script_options.rs`).\n- Extended MCP `get_post_options` / `set_post_options` (`crates/app/src/mcp/post_options_tools.rs`, `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`), scripting `cam.post({ options })` (`crates/app/src/script/api.rs`, `script/mod.rs`, `assets/scripts/cam.d.ts`), `camcraft-cli process --post-option <k=v>` (`crates/app/src/cli.rs`), and standalone `post --opt <k=v>` / `--list-options` (`crates/post/src/bin/post.rs`).\n- Added the floating desktop `Post` dialog with `Settings` and `Operations` tabs, output folder/filename memory, program number/comment fields, built-in post switches, and grouped declared script options (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/post_dialog.rs`, `post_dialog_tabs.rs`, `post_script_options.rs`, `post_options.rs`, `setup_post_page.rs`, `shell.rs`, `state.rs`, `state_per_op.rs`, `state_setup_post_options.rs`).\n- Recorded design decisions in `docs/decisions/258-post-options-dialog.md`.\n\n## Screenshots\n\nThe images use the shipping egui controls through the headless test harness.\nThe before images use the parent setup-page source from `af83da0f4`.\nThe after images show the Post dialog and the expanded Setup Post options.\n\n| Surface | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| Desktop Post settings | ![Document Post settings before the new dialog](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/2151/post-before.png) | ![New Post dialog](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/2151/post-after.png) |\n| Setup1 Post page | ![Setup1 Post page before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/2151/setup-post-before.png) | ![Setup1 Post page after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/2151/setup-post-after.png) |\n\nThe old desktop Post command opened a native save picker.\nIts before image shows the document Post settings page. The native picker is not captured.\nThe viewport and native file pickers are not exercised by these captures.\n\n## Cause\nThe desktop Post command previously opened only a plain file save picker, and `.cps` scripts had no typed `declaredOptions` metadata or per-post override storage across UI, project serialization, MCP, CLI, and scripting.\n\n## Tests\n- Pins:\n  - `crates/post/tests/declared_options.rs`: `shipped_milling_posts_declare_valid_option_schemas`, `malformed_schemas_and_bad_overrides_are_refused_by_name`, `fanuc_defaults_are_unchanged_and_declared_options_drive_output` (3 passed, 0 failed).\n  - `crates/app/tests/post_script_options.rs`: `document_and_setup_script_options_undo_redo_and_keep_per_post_memory`, `project_round_trips_script_options_and_flags_multi_setup_disagreement`, `mcp_and_cli_expose_and_validate_declared_post_options` (3 passed, 0 failed).\n  - `crates/ui/src/egui_app/post_dialog_tests.rs`: `desktop_post_command_opens_dialog_and_applies_declared_script_options_undoably`, `setup_post_page_also_renders_declared_script_options` (2 passed, 0 failed).\n- Mutations (all 5 run on `ec8fd4b06`):\n  - Reverted `assets/posts/fanuc.cps` to `upstream/main`: `declared_options` failed (1 passed, 2 failed); restored: passed (3 passed, 0 failed).\n  - Stubbed `validate_overrides` in `crates/post/src/post/options_parse.rs` to `Ok(())`: `malformed_schemas_and_bad_overrides_are_refused_by_name` failed (2 passed, 1 failed); restored: passed (3 passed, 0 failed).\n  - Stubbed `validate_for_post` in `crates/app/src/commands/post_script_options.rs` to `Ok(())`: `document_and_setup_script_options_undo_redo_and_keep_per_post_memory` failed (2 passed, 1 failed); restored: passed (3 passed, 0 failed).\n  - Omitted `script_disagreement_problem` check in `crates/app/src/setup_post_options.rs`: `project_round_trips_script_options_and_flags_multi_setup_disagreement` failed (2 passed, 1 failed); restored: passed (3 passed, 0 failed).\n  - Skipped setting `self.post_dialog` in `crates/ui/src/state_per_op.rs::post_program_dialog`: `desktop_post_command_opens_dialog_and_applies_declared_script_options_undoably` failed (1 passed, 1 failed); restored: passed (2 passed, 0 failed).\n- Clippy & Gate:\n  - `cargo clippy -p camcraft-post -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` (post-mutations): passed with 0 warnings.\n  - `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` (on `ec8fd4b06`, base `af83da0f4`): `post suites` passed (62 suites, 0 failed), `app suites` passed (328 suites, 0 failed), and `ui suites` passed all 14 integration suites (0 failed) and 907/908 lib tests; only `egui_app::tests::ai_chat::safety::post_confirmation_allow_and_deny_gate_mcp_dispatch` failed with the pre-existing `af83da0f4` timing flake (`#2137`, `Harness::run exceeded max_steps (4)`, fixed by open PR `#2142`).\n  - Re-ran the exact `ui suites` gate command post-mutations (`-j 6 -p camcraft-ui --no-fail-fast --lib` + all 14 integration suites): passed completely (908 passed, 0 failed, 6 ignored in `--lib`; all 14 integration suites passed, 0 failed).\n\n## Goldens moved\nNone (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n- Interactive native OS folder/save file pickers (desktop flow is exercised headlessly through `PostDialogState`, `ApplyPostDialog`, and `post_program_dialog`).\n- Non-default G-code output permutations across the seven non-Fanuc milling `.cps` scripts beyond `declaredOptions` schema validation (`fanuc.cps` non-default output overrides are pinned in `declared_options`; all eight shipped milling posts preserve default goldens unchanged).\n- Merging current `upstream/main` tip (`57f2ffbbf`), which currently fails to compile on unrelated P2 issue `#2143` (fixed by open PR `#2147`).\n\n## Overlaps\nTouches some of the same files in different functions or adjacent lines (whichever merges second refreshes): `#2149`, `#2140`, `#2136`, `#2134`, `#2126`, `#2125`, `#2123`, `#2115`, `#2110`, `#2101`, `#2093`, `#2092`, `#2091`, `#2089`, `#2083`, `#2077`, `#2048`, `#2037`, `#2024`, `#1821`, `#1817`, `#1798`, `#1738`, `#1681`, `#1330`, `#1209`, `#468`.\n\nProcess change: yes\nChangelog: feat(post): add Post dialog and per-post declared script options (#258)\nEffort: max\nFixes #258\n",
